</a>.','','none'),(7638,'The system will notify you when updates and important security releases are available for installed components. Anonymous information about your site is sent to <a href=\":drupal\">Drupal.org</a>.','','none'),(7639,'File Transfer failed, reason: @reason','','none'),(7640,'Unique field constraint','Validation','none'),(7641,'A @entity_type with @field_name %value already exists.','','none'),(7642,'The Aggregator module is an on-site syndicator and news reader that gathers and displays fresh content from RSS-, RDF-, and Atom-based feeds made available across the web. Thousands of sites (particularly news sites and blogs) publish their latest headlines in feeds, using a number of standardized XML-based formats. For more information, see the <a href=\":aggregator-module\">online documentation for the Aggregator module</a>.','','none'),(7643,'Configuring the display of feed items','','none'),(7644,'Discarding old feed items','','none'),(7645,'A <a href=\":aggregator-opml\">machine-readable OPML file</a> of all feeds is available. OPML is an XML-based file format used to share outline-structured information such as a list of RSS feeds. Feeds can also be <a href=\":import-opml\">imported via an OPML file</a>.','','none'),(7646,'A working <a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a> is required to update feeds automatically.','','none'),(7647,'Current feeds are listed below, and <a href=\":addfeed\">new feeds may be added</a>. For each feed, the <em>latest items</em> block may be enabled at the <a href=\":block\">blocks administration page</a>.','','none'),(7648,'@title feed','','none'),(7649,'No feeds available. <a href=\":link\">Add feed</a>.','','none'),(7650,'The length of time between feed updates. Requires a correctly configured <a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a>.','','none'),(7651,'Requires a correctly configured <a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a>.','','none'),(7652,'Administrators can enter IP addresses to ban on the <a href