s</a> to maintain a secure and current site. Always run the <a href=\":update-php\">update script</a> each time a module is updated.','','none'),(7803,'No update information available. <a href=\":run_cron\">Run cron</a> or <a href=\":check_manually\">check manually</a>.','','8.7.6'),(7804,'New release(s) available for @site_name','','8.6.4'),(7805,'Your site is currently configured to send these emails when any updates are available. To get notified only for security updates, @url.','','8.6.4'),(7806,'Your site is currently configured to send these emails only when security updates are available. To get notified for any available updates, @url.','','none'),(7807,'There was a problem checking <a href=\":update-report\">available updates</a> for Drupal.','','8.7.6'),(7808,'Automatic updating of Drupal core is not supported. See the <a href=\":upgrade-guide\">upgrade guide</a> for information on how to update Drupal core manually.','','none'),(7809,'See the <a href=\":available_updates\">available updates</a> page for more information and to install your missing updates.','','8.7.6'),(7810,'See the <a href=\":available_updates\">available updates</a> page for more information.','','none'),(7811,'You can find <a href=\":module_url\">modules</a> and <a href=\":theme_url\">themes</a> on <a href=\":drupal_org_url\">drupal.org</a>. The following file extensions are supported: %extensions.','','none'),(7812,'Back up your database and site before you continue. <a href=\":backup_url\">Learn how</a>.','','none'),(7813,'Deprecated: User Name','','none'),(7814,'Deprecated: Use account-name or display-name instead.','','none'),(7815,'The display name of the user account.','','none'),(7816,'Users with the %select-cancel-method or %administer-users <a href=\":permissions-url\">permissions</a> can override this default method.','','8.6.4'),(7817,'Available variables are: [site:name], [site:url], [user:display-name], [user:account-name], [user:mail], [site:login-url], [site:url-brief]